    "Scan of the 1982 edition of the Manistee, Michigan, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1977; field checked in 1979; last revised in 1982; printed in 1991.",
    "Release: Provisional. Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22.9 x 27.9 inches. Printed projection: Lambert Conformal Conic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
